<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Doondo</book>
  <para style="h">1 PETELO</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petelo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mukanda wuntete wu Petelo</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mukanda wuntete wu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Petelo</para>
  <para style="imt">Nkotolo</para>
  <para style="ip">Wu ni mukanda wuntete wusonika Petelo ku minkwikidi mi mbanza zitanu zi kizunga ki Aziya. Yesu bu kaba mu nza, Petelo wedi zyetanga nandi. Yesu bu kasisa nza beyiyi, Petelo wuba ntumwa yi Bayudayo.</para>
  <para style="ip">Minkwikidi mi kasonikina, ni myamyomyo mi bakwamisa mu dyambu di kimunu kyawu mu Mfumu Yesu-Klisto. Ni hahoho, Petelo kabasonikina mu bateela baba bakwikama nakekete mu kiminu. Wubateela ti, Yesu wu bana kwikila ni yandi wubakwamisa natee bu bamuhonda. Buna ta ti, bu bayena mpasi, bafweti vibidila bonso Yesu. Wubateela mpe bwedi bulendi beela kizingu kyawu ha kati di yobobo balembolo tambula Nzambi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Ndandani yi mukanda bewuwu ebu yidi:</para>
  <para style="io1">1) Zimbote (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:1-2">1.1-2</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">2) Kivuvu ki kwikama (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:3-12">1.3-12</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">3) Luzingu lu bulongo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 1:13-2:17">1.13–2.17</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">4) Klisto wuyena mpasi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 2:18-25">2.18-25</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">5) Munkwikidi na zimpasi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 3:1-4:19">3.1–4.19</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">6) Bwedi zimfumu zi minkwikidi zilendi dyatila (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:1-11">5.1-11</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">7) Mbote zi manunu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1PE 5:12-14">5.12-14</ref></char>)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zimbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Meno Petelo, ntumwa yi Yesu-Klisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:1">Nina sonika ku bantu Nzambi ba kasoola na bakwe zinganga mu zinsi zinzenza, mpe bamwangana mu nsi yi Ponti, yi Ngalatiya, yi Kapadose, yi Aziya, na yi Bitini. <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />Tata Nzambi wulusoola ntama bonso bubela makani mandi, na wulubyeka mu nzila yi Mpeve andi, mwanki luba na lutumumu mpe luba bavedila mu menga ma Yesu-Klisto.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Bika Nzambi kaluhaana lusakumunu na kiyenge mu kitezo kihyokidi.<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kivuvu kikedika mu luzingu lumoona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Masiika ku Nzambi, Tata di Mfumu eto Yesu-Klisto! Mu bunene bu bumbote bwandi, wusa ti tubutuka mbutuka yimoona bu kafulukisa Yesu-Klisto mu bafwa, mwanki tuba na kivuvu kikedika, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />mu kinganga fwa Nzambi di kakubikila bantu bandi. Fwa bedyodyo dilendi fuuka ko, dilendi biha ko, mpe dilendi zimbisa kitoko kyandi ko. Nzambi wulukubikila dyo mu mazulu, <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />ku yeno Nzambi ba kakwe kebanga mu lulendo lwandi, mu nzila yi kiminu natee mu ntangu yaakwiza mpulusu, yoyoyo yi kakubika mu lonka mu ntangu yi nsukunu.<verse eid="1PE 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Ni hahoho, luu bafuluka mu kyese, mpeleko bulendi ba ti mu mwa ntangu yifyoti, luba mu kyadi, mu dyambu di mpasi zi mumpila mu mpila. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Mwanki mfunu yi bunene bu kiminu kyeno- kivudi mfunu na wola dikwe bebanga mpeleko bakwe yokanga dyo ku tiya- yitambula masiika, nkembo na nzitusu mu ntangu Yesu-Klisto yi kaayenika. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Lukwe mu tyanga mpeleko lumuyena ko, lukwe mu kwikilanga mpeleko lwamuyeni ko. Mpe luu bafuluka mu kyese kihyokidi kilembolo ba na bwe teela, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />mu dyambu ti luna tambula mpulusu yi myela myeno bonso mufutu wu kiminu kyeno.<verse eid="1PE 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Mimbikudi misosa na mitoma fyongonina misamu mitadidi mpulusu beyoyo. Yawu babikula mu dyambu di munkayulu wulukubikila Nzambi mu tambula. <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />Basosa mu zaba nkye ntangu na bwedi misamu bemyomyo myaahidimina, bonso bu balonkila myo Mpeve yi Klisto yiba mu yawu. Yikizonzila mpasi zaayena Klisto, mpe mukembo waakwiza ku mutwala. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />Nzambi wubazabikisa ti, misamu mi bata, ka mu dyambu di yawu bende ko, kansi mu dyambu dyeno. Bwabu musamu bewowo, milongisi mi Musamu Wumbote wabaluzabikisi, mu lulendo lu Mpeve Yilongo yifuma ku yulu. Zimbazi mpe zii na mpwila yiyingi mu zaba musamu bewowo.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nkadulu yi bulongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Ni hahoho, beeno bakubama na kayeeno meso. Tuleeno kivuvu kyeno kimvimba mu bumbote bu baalusiila mu ntangu Yesu-Klisto yi kaayenika. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Bonso baala bakwe tumamanga, lulandandi nsatu zimbi ziteka ba neeno mu ntama, bu luba ku nsye bunzimbu. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Kansi beeno balongo mu nkadulu eno yimvimba, bonso Nzambi wulutumisi kadi wulongo. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Mu dyambu wuu wusonama ti: «Lufweti ba balongo, kadi nidi wulongo.»<verse eid="1PE 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Tala ti lukwe sambilanga Tata, yondowo wukwe lembolo swasikisanga mu ntangu yi kaafundisa muntu-muntu bonso buu nkadulu andi, buna, mu ntangu yisidi neeno mu zinga ha butoto, lufweti dyatila mu kivumi. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Luzebi ti, ka mu dyambu di bima bikwe fukilanga ko, bonso mbongo hoti wola, balukuudila mu mbelo yimbi yi sala lusisila zinkaka zeno, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />kansi mu menga ma ntalu ma Klisto, wukiyekola bonso mwana dimeme dilembolo ba na kyeta na mvindu. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Nzambi wumusoola tekila nza yi hilama. Mu dyambu dyeno kamuyenikisi mu ntangu beyiyi yi nsukunu. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Mu yandi, lukwe kwikilanga mu Nzambi wumufulukisa mu bafwa, na wumuhaana nkembo, mwanki kiminu kyeno na kivuvu kyeno kiba mu Nzambi.<verse eid="1PE 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Luvedisi myela myeno bu lutumimini kikedika, mu zolasana mu kimpangi wulembolo ba na diisu ku nsye lukaya. Buna tomeeno zolasana yeno na yeno mu mutima wuvedila. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Mu dyambu wuu wusonama ti, lubutukidi mbutuka yimoona, ka mu nkuna yikwe fwanga ko, kansi mu nkuna yikwe lembolo fwanga mu nzila yi Mambu ma Nzambi, maa moyo na makwe sikilanga ntangu zimvimba. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Mu dyambu wuu wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">« Kadi muntu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">wuu bonso kititi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">na nkembo andi wumvimba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">bonso kifulu ki kititi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">kititi kikwe yumanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">na kifulu kikwe sotokanga,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />kansi Mambu ma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:25">Mfumu makwe sikilanga</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:25">mimvu ka mimvu.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Mambu bemomo ni Musamu Wumbote wubalusamunina.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="s1">Tadi dimoyo na mukangu wulongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Buna, looseeno misamu myeno mimvimba mimbi na madyela ma luvunu, diisu ku nsye lukaya, nzinunu na matoola. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Bonso baala bansombe, tomeeno banga na nsatu ye nwanga mabene malembolo vwatusu ma Mambu ma Nzambi, mwanki bu lwaanwanga mo, lukula mpe lubaka mpulusu, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />tala ti, «lubimbidi ti Mfumu wumbote kadi.»<verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Finameeno ku Mfumu, yandi ni tadi dimoyo dinyafunu ku bantu, kansi ha meso ma Nzambi dii disoolo na dintalu didi. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Yeno mpe, bonso matadi mamoyo, biika balusadila mu tunga nzo yi kimpeve. Mbo luhidika kabu di zinganga-Nzambi zivwihu ku Nzambi, mbo lumuhaana minkayulu mi Mpeve myaamuyangidika mu nzila yi Yesu-Klisto. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Mu dyambu ti, basonika mu Masonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">«Tala, nsoodidi tadi di mfunu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">mpe ntudidi dyo mu mbanza yi Syoni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">bonso tadi divudidi mfunu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">Wonso muntu waakwikila dyo, kaayena nsoni ko.»<verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Tadi bedyodyo nkatika mfunu didi ku yeno lukwe kwikilanga. Kansi ku yobobo bakwe lembolo kwikilanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">«Tadi dinyafuna bitungi bi nzo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">dyeka tadi divudidi mfunu.»<verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Basonika mpe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">«Tadi dikwe tesisanga masakuba</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">mpe dikwe bwisanga.»</para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Bantu bakwe di telanga makuba mu dyambu ti bakwe bisanga mu tumama mu Mambu ma Nzambi, mpe misamu myamyomyo babakubikila.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Kansi yeno, ludi kanda disoolo, zinganga-Nzambi zi ntinu, nsi yilongo, mpe mukangu wuvwihu ku Nzambi. Wulubookila mu katuka mu kitombe mu kwiza ku kya kwandi kungitukulu, mwanki lusamuna mavanga mandi mambote. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Mu ntama yeno luba mukangu wu Nzambi ko, Kansi bwabu lweka mukangu andi. Mu ntama Nzambi kalufwila nkenda ko, kansi bwabu wulufwididi nkenda.<verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuzinga bonso kisadi ki Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Mpangi zani zizola, nina lubombidila mu ba bonso mimpyoka nzila na bantu banzenza ha luse lu butoto bebubu. Bikeeno nsatu zeno zi kinsuni zikwe nwanisanga mwela. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Beeno na nkadulu yimbote ha kati di bantu balembolo zaba Nzambi, mwanki, kati bana zonza misamu mi mbi mu yeno bonso bantu bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbi, bu baayena mbelo eno yimbote, yawu baakembisa Nzambi kilumbu ki kaakwiza.<verse eid="1PE 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Beeno batumama ku zimfumu zimvimba, mu dyambu di Mfumu: Tumameeno ku ntinu mu dyambu ti wuna yaala bantu bamvimba, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />na ku minyadi mi bizunga mi tambuku mu semba bimpumbulu mpe mu siika bantu bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbote. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Kadi, luzolo lu Nzambi ludi ti yeno luhidika misamu mimbote, mwanki lukanga minwa mi bantu balembolo ba na madyela na mpisulu. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Dyatileeno bonso bantu baa na kimpwanza, kansi kimpwanza bekyokyo kikitukandi bonso mulele wuna fuka mambi meno. Kansi beeno bonso bisadi bi Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Zitiseeno bantu bamvimba, zoleeno zimpangi zeno zi kiminu, vumineeno Nzambi, mpe zitiseeno ntinu.<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kifwani ki zimpasi zi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Yeno bisadi, bangeeno batumama ku zimfumu zeno na kivumi kimvimba. Lutumamanangandi kaka zimfumu zii na lembami na mutima wumbote ko, kansi na zozozo mpe zii na mutima wumbalu. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Mu dyambu di kutumama mu Nzambi, bumbote budi mu vibidila mpasi zi bana luyenisa zi lulembolo zabila dyambu. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Kadi, nkye ndandu mu vibidila bikoti tala ti musamu wumbi luhidikidi e? Kansi tala ti luna vibidila mpasi mu musamu wumbote wu luhidikidi, zabeeno ti ha meso ma Nzambi musamu wumbote wudi. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Musamu wawowo Nzambi kalutumisina, mu dyambu ti Klisto wuyena mpasi mu dyambu dyeno. Ni hahoho, yandi kalusisila kifwani, mwanki lulanda ntambi zandi. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Yandi kahola masumu ko, mpe nakani musamu wu luvunu wuduuka mu munwa andi ko.<verse eid="1PE 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Bu bamutuka, kavutula kani kituku ko. Bu bamuyenisa mpasi, kakana kani muntu ko, kansi wukiyekola ku Nzambi wukwe fundisanga mu lunungu. <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Wunata mu nitu andi masumu meto ha kulunsi, mwanki bu twaafwa mu dyambu di masumu, tuzinga mu lunungu bonso budi luzolo lwandi. Kadi mu zimputa zandi lubakila lunyakusu. <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Mu dyambu ti luba bonso mameme ma zimbala, kansi bwabu luvutukidi ku yondowo wudi mumvungi na wukwe kebanga myela myeto.<verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bakento na babakala bawu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Bumosi mpe ku yeno bakento, lufweti tumimina balumi beeno. Mwanki tala ti balumi bahiika bana kwikila mu Mambu ma Nzambi ko, balendi kwikila mu dyambu di nkadulu yi bakento bawu, wulembolo zonza dyambu. <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />Mu dyambu ti yawu baayena bwedi nkadulu eno yidi yivedila na yikivumi. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Lusosandi mu kiyenikisa mu bima bikwe yenikanga mu meso bonso: kukangusu milengi, misanga miwola, hoti binkutu bintalu. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Kansi soseeno kitoko ki kati di mutima, kitoko kikwe lembolo bebanga, ni mpeve yi lembami na yi kizunu, mpe yii na mfunu yiyingi ha ntadisi yi Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Ni bwabobo bubela mu ntama, kitoko ki bakento balongo bedi sanga kivuvu mu Nzambi. Yawu bedi tumiminanga balumi bawu, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />bonso Sala wedi tumiminanga Abalahami na wedi mu mutumisinanga «mfumu ani.» Yeno lukitukidi baala bandi ba bakento tala ti luhidikidi misamu mimbote, wulembolo yena bunkuta bu kima.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Bumosi mpe ku yeno balumi, zingangeeno na bakazi beeno bumbote. Zabeeno ti baa na ngolo zizingi bonso yeno ko, mpe Bavuminangeeno, mu dyambu ti bafweti tambula ha kimosi neeno fwa di luzingu bonso munkayulu wu Nzambi. Sadileeno bobo, mwanki nakani kima kilembolo kakidila zinsambulu zeno.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuyena mpasi na kuhidika misamu mi mbote</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Mu manisa, yeno bamvimba bangangeeno na mayindu mamosi, na yeninangeeno baneeno kyadi. Bangangeeno na zola ku kimpangi, na mitima mimbote mpe bantu bakuluka ha ntadisi yibahiika. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Luvutulangandi mbi mu mbi ko, hoti bituku mu bituku ko. Kansi, sakumunangeeno, mu dyambu ti Nzambi bu kalutumisa wulusila nsilulu mu tambula fwa di lusakumunu. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Mu dyambu wu wusonama ti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">«Wonso tiidi luzingu na</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">Tiidi mu yena bilumbu bimbote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">kafweti zaba mu keba ludimi lwandi mu lembolo ta misamu mambi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">na bikoba byandi mu lembolo dukisa mpova zi luvunu.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Fweti tiina misamu mimbi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">mpe kahidika misamu mimbote,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:11">katatamana mu sosa kiyenge mpe kakeba kyo .<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Mu dyambu ti meso ma Mfumu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">makwe yenanga bantu balunungu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">na makutu mandi makwe toma yuwanga lusambulu lwawu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:12">kansi Mfumu kwe tekanga manima yobobo bakwe hidikanga misamu mimbi.»<verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Nani lendi lusa bubi tala ti yeno ludi na vema mu hidika misamu mimbote e? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Mpeleko mpasi luna yena mu dyambu ti luna hidika misamu mi lunungu, beeno mu kyese! Lubandi na bunkuta bu bahiika ko mpe mayindu meno mabandi yeku-yeku ko. <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Kansi, mu mitima myeno, zitiseeno Klisto bonso Mfumu. Beeno ntangu zimvimba bakubama mu haana mvutu ku yobobo bamvimba balufula mu babangudila mfunu yi kivuvu kii mu yeno. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Kansi lufweti bwe sa mu lembami na mu kivumi. Beeno na mayindu mambote, mwanki yobobo bana zonzila bumbi mu dyambu di nkadulu eno yimbote mu Klisto, bayena nsoni mu matoola mawu. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Mu dyambu ti budi bumbote mu yena mpasi bu wuna hidika misamu mimbote, tala ti bwabobo budi luzolo lu Nzambi, kansi ka mu hidika misamu mimbi ko.<verse eid="1PE 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Kadi, Klisto yandi bende wuyena mpasi kimankululu, mu dyambu di masumu ma bantu, yandi wulunungu wuyena mpasi mu dyambu di bantu balembolo ba balunungu, mwanki kalunata ku Nzambi. Mu nsuni andi bamuhonda, kansi mu mpeve Nzambi wumuvutula wumoyo.<verse eid="1PE 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Mu lulendo lu Mpeve beyoyo, wuyenda samuna Musamu Wumbote ku mpeve ziba mu boloko, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />zazozo zi lembolo tumimina Nzambi, bu kedi vibidilanga mu ntangu Nowa yi kedi tunga nzaza. Mwa bantu bafyuma kwandi, yawu naana bakota mu nzaza na bavuuka mu nyamba. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Nyamba beyoyo yiba kifwani ki mbotokolo kina luhaana bwabu mpulusu. Yiba mvedosolo yi nitu ko, kansi mu lomba ku Nzambi mu ba na mayindu mambote. Bwabobo luvukila, mu nzila yi mfulukulu yi Yesu-Klisto, <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />wuyenda ku yulu na wuzakala ha lubakala lu Nzambi, kokoko, zimbazi, mfumu zizinene na mfumu zii na mpeve zii na lulendo lu mazulu zii ku nsye lumutumu lwandi.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Kusisa luzingu luntama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Klisto bu kayena mpasi mu nitu andi, yeno mpe beeno bakubama mu yena mpasi bonso yandi: yondowo yeni mpasi mu nitu andi kalendi bwesa hola masumu ko. <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />Tuka ntangu beyiyi, mu bilumbu bisidi neeno ha luse lu butoto, lufweti zinga bonso budi luzolo lu Nzambi, kansi ka bonso nsatu zi nitu zeno ko. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Mu dyambu ti luhyokisi ntangu yiyingi mu hidika luzolo lu yobobo balembolo zaba Nzambi. Luzingidi mu kindumba, nsatu zimbi zi nitu, kukolo malamu, kindyafu, kinduvu na kusambila biteki ni dyambu dihyokidi bubi. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Kadi bwabu, yobobo balembolo zaba Nzambi bana yituku, mu dyambu ti luna bwesa ba kintwadi nawu ko mu nkadulu zimbi zi hyokidi kitezo. Ni hahoho yawu bakwe lutukilanga. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Kansi yawu mbo bavutula mvutu kuu Nzambi mu mavanga mawu, Nzambi wudi wukubama mu fundisa bantu bamoyo na bafwa. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Ni bwabobo Musamu Wumbote wusamunu mpe ku bantu bafwa, mwanki, ku manima mamfundusulu awu bonso bantu bamvimba bakwe zinganga ha luse lu butoto, bazinga bonso Nzambi mu kimpeve.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bisadi bimbote bi minkayulu mi Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Nsukunu yi misamu mimvimba yeka lukufi. Ni hahoho, beeno na ndwenga na lukiyaala, mwanki lukiyekola mu lusambulu. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Dyambu dintete, zolasaneeno yeno na yeno, mu dyambu ti zola kukwe fukanga masumu mamingi. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />Bwanangeeno zimpangi zeno wulembolo mvungutulu. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Biika kadi muntu kasadila munkayulu wukatambudi mu sadisa banandi. Beeno bisadi bimbote bina sadila minkayulu mi mumpila mu mpila mi Nzambi. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Tala ti muntu wuna zonza, bika kasamuna Mambu ma Nzambi, tala ti muntu wuna sadisa banandi, bika kasadisa mu ngolo zina muhaana Nzambi, mwanki mu mimvimba Nzambi kakemboso mu Yesu-Klisto. Nkembo na lulendo bivwihulu ku yandi mu mimvu ka mimvu. Ameni!<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mpasi zi munsambidi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Mpangi zani zizola, luyitukwandi ko mu ba ha kati di tiya tu mfyetokoso, bonso ti musamu wunzenza wulutudidi. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Kansi yangalaleeno bu ludi kintwadi na mpasi zi yena Klisto, mwanki nkembo andi bu waayenika, lufuluka mu kyese. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Beeno mu kyese, tala ti balutukidi mu dyambu di nkumbu yi Klisto, mu dyambu ti Mpeve yi Nzambi yii na nkembo yidi mu yeno. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Ka muntu ko ha kati dyeno kayena mpasi bonso mumpondi hoti mwivi, hoti muntu wukwe hidikanga misamu mimbi hoti bonso muntu wukwe kwe kotingi mu misamu mingana. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Kansi tala ti muntu wuna yena mpasi mu dyambu ti mu-Klisto kadi, kayenandi nsoni ko, kadi kakembila Nzambi mu musamu bewowo.<verse eid="1PE 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Mu dyambu ti ntangu yatona mfundusu yifweni, ku kanda di Nzambi yina tonina. Tala ti ku yeto yina tonina, bwedi bwabu nsukunu yaabela ku yobobo bakwe lembolo kwikilanga mu Musamu Wumbote wu Nzambi e? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Bonso buna ta Masonama:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">«Tala ti muntu wulunungu mu mpasi kana bakila mpulusu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">Buna bwedi bwaabeela muntu wumbalu na munsumuki e<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zing 11.31.</char></note>?»<verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Ni hahoho, yobobo bana yena mpasi bonso buu luzolo lu Nzambi, bika bakiyekola yawu bende mu moko ma Kihidiki kikwikama, mpe batatamana mu hidika misamu mimbote.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Kisalu ki bakuluntu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Nina syamisa [bwabu] bakuluntu ba dibundu baa ha kati dyeno. Meno bende mukuluntu niidi bonso yawu, mbangi yi mona meso mu mpasi zi Klisto mpe nina ba kintwadi mu nkembo andi waayenika. Misamu myamyomyo nina lulomba: <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Beeno mimvungi mi kamba di mameme di luheeni Nzambi, bakengeeno, ka bonso bantu ba bana kwikisa ko, kansi mu mutima wumbote, bonso bukwe tyanga Nzambi. Sadileeno bobo, ka mu sosa kimvwama ko, kansi mu vema di kusadila. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Ka lusosandi mu kwamisa yobobo ba baluheeni mu keba, kansi beeno kifwani kimbote ku kamba di mameme. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Ni hahoho, mu ntangu yaayenika Mfumu yi mimvungi mi mameme, lwaatambula musendo wu mpu yi nkembo yalembolo zimbisa kulezima kwandi.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Bumosi mpe ku zintwenya, bangangeeno batumama ku bihunda. Bangangeeno bakuluka ha kati di zimpangi zeno, mu dyambu ti Masonama mana ta ti: «Nzambi kwe belanga banga mayama, kansi kwe yangalalanga bakwe kikululanga.» <verse eid="1PE 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Ni hahoho, lukikulula ku nsye kooko ku lulendo lu Nzambi, mwanki kaluzangula mu ntangu yifweni. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Muyekodileeno manyongo meno mamvimba, mu dyambu ti yandi kwe lusadisanga.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />Lufweti kiyaala mpe kayeeno meso! Mu dyambu ti mutantu eno, nkadyampemba, wuna zyeta bifuulu bimvimba bonso nkosi yina samba, mpe wuna sosa nani kaadya. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Musyamineeno mu kiminu kii na kekete, bambukeeno moyo ti mpangi zeno mu nza yimvimba mpasi zimosi kwandi zina yena. <verse eid="1PE 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Nzambi yikwe lulonkanga bumbote bwandi yilutumisa mu Yesu-Klisto ku nkembo andi wu mimvu ka mimvu. Ku manina bu lwa mana yena mpasi mu mwa ntangu yifyoti, waalulungisa yandi bende, waalusyamisa, waaluhaana ngolo, mpe waalutedimisa ha lufulu lu nakekete. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />Bika lulendo lusikila ku yandi mimvu ka mimvu! Ameni!<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zimbote zi mansukina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Nalusonikini mukanda wuwukufi bewuwu mu lusadusu lu silase wu nakwe bongilanga bonso mpangi yikwikama. Ntiidi mu lusyamisa mpe mu luteela kimbangi ti nkatika mu mulemvo wu Nzambi luu bakangama nakekete.<verse eid="1PE 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Dibundu di ekuku, ku mbanza Babiloni, disoola Nzambi bonso yeno na Malako mwana ani, mbote balutambikidi. <verse eid="1PE 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Haanasaneeno yeno na yeno mbote yi zola yi kubumbasana.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Bika kiyenge ki Nzambi kiba mu yeno bamvimba luvwihu ku Klisto!<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>